[chant:0184 prelude-sabba-patti-dana-gatha]
[00:00.00]1 Handa mayaṁ sabba-patti-dāna-gāthāyo bhaṇāmase

[chant:0037 sabba-patti-dana-gatha]
[00:07.74]1 Puññass'idāni katassa
[00:11.29]2 Yān'aññāni katāni me
[00:15.13]3 Tesañca bhāgino hontu
[00:18.51]4 Sattānantāppamāṇakā
[00:22.15]5 Ye piyā guṇavantā ca
[00:25.67]6 Mayhaṁ mātā-pitādayo
[00:29.78]7 Diṭṭhā me cāpyadiṭṭhā vā
[00:33.41]8 Aññe majjhatta-verino
[00:36.80]9 Sattā tiṭṭhanti lokasmiṁ
[00:41.26]10 Te bhummā catu-yonikā
[00:45.12]11 Pañc'eka-catu-vokārā
[00:48.67]12 Saṁsarantā bhavābhave
[00:52.22]13 Ñātaṁ ye patti-dānam-me
[00:56.12]14 Anumodantu te sayaṁ
[00:59.24]15 Ye c'imaṁ nappajānanti
[01:02.68]16 Devā tesaṁ nivedayuṁ
[01:06.38]17 Mayā dinnāna-puññānaṁ anumodana-hetunā
[01:13.47]18 Sabbe sattā sadā hontu
[01:17.06]19 Averā sukha-jīvino
[01:20.14]20 Khemappadañca pappontu
[01:23.68]21 Tesāsā sijjhataṁ subhā
